<section id="test-site">
<h1>Test site <a class="lsd-anchor" href="#test-site" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h1>
<p>A page with the markup render-html writes: <em>emphasis</em>, <code>code</code>, a
<a href="guide/setup.html">link</a> and a footnote<sup class="lsd-footnote-ref"><a href="#fn-1" id="fnref-1">1</a></sup>.</p>
<div class="lsd-admonition" data-kind="note">
